==================================================================
DocuShield - Private Legal Document Triage Agent
Tools, Frameworks, and Technologies Used
==================================================================

1. CORE AI & INFERENCE ENGINE
------------------------------------------------------------------
- Google Gemma Edge-Class LLM (gemma4:e2b / gemma2:2b):
  On-device language model for clause extraction, plain-language 
  simplification, risk flagging, calibrated silence, and lawyer escalation.
- Ollama:
  Local runtime and model server running entirely on loopback 
  (127.0.0.1:11434) with zero cloud network egress.
- ollama-python:
  Official Python library used for local chat generation and real-time 
  token streaming.

2. APPLICATION FRAMEWORK & UI
------------------------------------------------------------------
- Python 3.10+:
  Primary runtime language for agent orchestration.
- Streamlit:
  Interactive web application framework used to build the trustworthy,
  high-contrast, non-lawyer accessible triage dashboard.
- HTML5 / CSS3:
  Custom styles injected into Streamlit for high-trust visual cards,
  sidebar indicators, and responsive layouts.

3. IN-MEMORY DOCUMENT PARSING (PRIVACY COMPLIANT)
------------------------------------------------------------------
- pypdf:
  Local PDF parsing engine used to extract document text directly 
  within memory without creating cached files on disk.
- Python io.BytesIO:
  In-memory byte buffer ensuring strict zero-disk persistence 
  for uploaded user documents.

4. DEVELOPMENT & REPOSITORY HYGIENE
------------------------------------------------------------------
- Visual Studio Code (VS Code):
  Primary code editor, terminal environment, and Git staging interface.
- Windows PowerShell:
  Command-line interface used for running the local server, managing 
  execution policies, and executing network audits.
- Git:
  Distributed version control for commits, branching, and rebasing.
- GitHub & Git Credential Manager:
  Open-source hosting platform for repository submission 
  (ZERODAY-2026/cyberSpader-size-1-) and browser-based OAuth authentication.

5. PRIVACY AUDITING & HARDWARE RUNTIME
------------------------------------------------------------------
- PowerShell Get-NetTCPConnection:
  Network socket auditing tool used to verify zero external egress 
  and confirm Ollama binds strictly to local loopback.
- NVIDIA CUDA / GeForce RTX 3050:
  Hardware acceleration target running quantized 4-bit weights 
  within a ~1.8 GB VRAM footprint.
